kunzite: Adreno 710 steps 6-7, read-only inside the powered CX half (kgpu=6/7; 1-5 unchanged).
6: GMU 0x3d68000 (kgsl gen7_reg.h numbers): CM3 sysreset/boot/fw_init/cfg, HFI status, power
state, AO status, both always-on counters with their rate over 10 ms (19.2 MHz = the block
answers), first ITCM/DTCM words; GBIF cx_config/scache/halt/halt_ack; CX misc AHB controls.
7: RSCC 0x3d50000 status/sequencer/4 slots and the GMU's rscc_control_ack; PDC 0xb270000
enable and seq-start. Both need CX on and cx_gmu running (steps 4-5), whose writes are still
undone at the end of the run.

